        21: `[TITLE] "On the Shore We Pray"

[Verse 1]  
From the shores of Tyre we rise,  
With hearts prepared to sail the skies,  
Through the waves and winds we find,  
Your Spirit guiding, love entwined.  
Disciples gather, hands held high,  
For every tear, we lift a cry,  
In unity, our voices blend,  
Together, Lord, on You we depend.

[Chorus]  
On the shore we pray, let Your will be done,  
As we journey forth, united as one.  
With courage in our hearts, we will follow Your way,  
Oh Lord, we trust in You, on this blessed day.

[Verse 2]  
In the house of Philip, we abide,  
With prophesies, the truth our guide,  
Agabus speaks, a warning clear,  
Yet Paul stands strong, without a fear.  
For the name of Jesus, he’ll go forth,  
To Jerusalem, proclaiming Your worth,  
Though trials come, we stand as one,  
In Your embrace, our race is run.

[Chorus]  
On the shore we pray, let Your will be done,  
As we journey forth, united as one.  
With courage in our hearts, we will follow Your way,  
Oh Lord, we trust in You, on this blessed day.

[Bridge]  
Through the storms and every fight,  
We will shine Your love, bring forth the light.  
In every heart, let hope arise,  
For in Your name, we will not compromise.

[Chorus]  
On the shore we pray, let Your will be done,  
As we journey forth, united as one.  
With courage in our hearts, we will follow Your way,  
Oh Lord, we trust in You, on this blessed day.

[Outro]  
As we sail from shore to shore,  
With every step, we seek You more.  
In every nation, every land,  
We’ll carry forth, Your love we'll stand.  
On the shore we pray, let Your will be done,  
Oh Lord, we trust in You, our journey's just begun.`,
        28: `[TITLE] Faithful in the Fire

[Verse 1]  
We were lost, tossed on the sea,  
In the storm, You rescued me.  
On Melita’s shore, Your grace was found,  
In the warmth of kindness all around.  
Though the viper strikes, I will stand tall,  
For in Your arms, I will not fall.  

[Chorus]  
Shake off the fear, shake off the pain,  
Your love surrounds me through the rain.  
You’re my healer, my hope, my song,  
In every trial, You make me strong.  
I will rise, I will proclaim,  
Your Kingdom come, forever reign.  

[Verse 2]  
Through the dark, I see Your light,  
With every step, You guide me right.  
From prison chains to the open door,  
You bring the lost to seek You more.  
With every heartbeat, I will declare,  
Your mighty works, Your endless care.  

[Chorus]  
Shake off the fear, shake off the pain,  
Your love surrounds me through the rain.  
You’re my healer, my hope, my song,  
In every trial, You make me strong.  
I will rise, I will proclaim,  
Your Kingdom come, forever reign.  

[Bridge]  
You’ve called me out, I’ll walk in faith,  
Your promises stand, they will not break.  
In every nation, Your name is known,  
Salvation’s call, to every home.  
With hearts on fire, we will unite,  
To share Your love, to shine Your light.  

[Chorus]  
Shake off the fear, shake off the pain,  
Your love surrounds me through the rain.  
You’re my healer, my hope, my song,  
In every trial, You make me strong.  
I will rise, I will proclaim,  
Your Kingdom come, forever reign.  

[Outro]  
In the fire, I will stand,  
With Your love, I’ll take this land.  
We’ll tell the world of all You’ve done,  
With open hearts, we’ll rise as one.`,
